# 7. Cron ⭐⭐⭐

Cron is used to schedule recurring tasks.

Syntax:

```text
* * * * * command
│ │ │ │ │
│ │ │ │ └── Day of week
│ │ │ └──── Month
│ │ └────── Day of month
│ └──────── Hour
└────────── Minute
```

### Every minute

```cron
* * * * * command
```

### Every 5 minutes

```cron
*/5 * * * * command
```

### Every day at 2 AM

```cron
0 2 * * * command
```

### Every Sunday at 3 AM

```cron
0 3 * * 0 command
```

### Every day at 1 AM

```cron
0 1 * * * command
```

